# Gmail — auto-email purchase/payment PDF slips to your inbox (forward to WhatsApp yourself)
# 1) Google Account → Security → 2-Step Verification ON
# 2) Security → App passwords → Mail → generate 16-char password
# 3) Set on Railway (use the Gmail that should SEND, usually same as inbox):
# GMAIL_USER=rahulnitingupta741@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
# NOTIFY_EMAIL=rahulnitingupta741@gmail.com
# (NOTIFY_EMAIL defaults to GMAIL_USER if omitted)
